        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova wakaambila Joshua kuti, Buzuba obuno ndatalika kukulemya mumeso aaba-Israyeli boonse, bazibe kuti mbuli mbundakali a-Musa njooba ayebo mbubonya, ",
